WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Read the commission context
Check the workspace. Match each commission to its order, rate, currency
and status. A captured or settled commission is separate from the vendor
receiving a payout.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Check the period statement
Check the workspace. Check statement period, currency, net amount and
status. Gross sales, commission deductions and paid net are not
interchangeable figures.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Read the purchase document
Check the workspace. Your total is the vendor share shown in this
workspace. It can differ from the full purchase invoice paid by the
customer.

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Choose a generated report
Check the workspace. Select the report, period and dates together. Not
ready or not generated can mean no matching snapshot; do not interpret
it as zero business activity.

